{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["And the meaning of <b>for no man shall see Me and live</b> is not that he will see Him and then die, but rather that before he can attain the vision, his soul will depart from him. For even regarding visions of angels it is said, \"My inward parts were turned upside down at the appearance\" (Daniel 10:16)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {0 "The Hebrew מראות המלאכים is rendered literally as 'visions of angels'; the Daniel citation uses the phrase נהפכו צירי עלי rendered here as 'my inward parts were turned upside upon me.'"}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:20:57.362680511Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}